<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Italtile half yr headline shr, div rise.</title>
<headline>Italtile half yr headline shr, div rise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		46.7	  vs 36.0</p>
<p>    - attrib		  46.7	  vs 36.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 9.0	   vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   8.54	  vs 6.60</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   12.70	 vs 9.96</p>
<p>    Tax			 4.09	  vs 3.35</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   none	  vs 0.45</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.96	  vs 0.40</p>
<p>    Turnover		  131.77	vs 123.28</p>
<p>Div payable March 14</p>
<p>on register February 28.</p>
<p>Full name: Italtile Limited</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said it expected to produce continued real growth in earnings as several new group-owned and franchised outlets start trading in the coming six months. Despite general market predictions of sluggish retail sales, it anticipates continued growth in sales and profitability for the second half of the year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
